+ *     env -u ATOMATON_MACHINERY_ROOT bun run test   ->  1402 pass / 59 fail, 1461 tests, 124 files
+ *     bun run test:e2e                              ->  0 pass / 5 skip / 3 fail, 8 tests, 4 files
+ *
