+ * `dist/.github/workflows` — every one of them under `dist/` and none under any other.
+ * The three extra failures in the first line are `run_environment_setup.ts`, which is
+ * #18's subject rather than this one, and they are why the two lines differ.
+ *
+ * `bun run synth` takes 0.4s. An agent that does not already know to type it cannot tell
+ * those failures from ones its own change caused, which is the damage the issue names:
+ * the same one the hermetic-environment test beside this one exists for.
